WEBVTT

00:15:28.156 --> 00:15:30.596
somehow, I got a loan
and 2,500 bucks came.

00:15:30.636 --> 00:15:32.636
And the story continued.

00:15:32.676 --> 00:15:35.396
And so when you're saying
about doing something tangible,

00:15:35.436 --> 00:15:37.076
it's not just me saying that like,

00:15:37.116 --> 00:15:39.636
you have to have some feeling
of control and autonomy

00:15:39.636 --> 00:15:42.076
in what is a world where you feel adrift

00:15:42.076 --> 00:15:44.236
and the ground is shifting
beneath your feet.

00:15:44.276 --> 00:15:46.876
Those small chores
that you take for granted,

00:15:46.916 --> 00:15:48.956
they'll give you order, some discipline.

00:15:48.996 --> 00:15:51.516
I’m making that chai. I’m painting this.

00:15:51.556 --> 00:15:54.276
I’m feeding my children.
I took out the trash.

00:15:54.316 --> 00:15:55.676
I did some work today.

00:15:55.716 --> 00:15:57.836
I can control this.
I did this with my hands.

00:15:57.876 --> 00:15:59.436
I'm still alive, right?

00:15:59.476 --> 00:16:02.156
And then you plot
and you do the best you can,